---
// CardParents: Introductory verse & parents of groom and bride
---

<div class="section-intro">
  <p class="intro-paragraph">
    CON GRAN ALEGRÍA Y CORAZONES AGRADECIDOS, JUNTO CON NUESTROS PADRES, LES
    INVITAMOS A COMPARTIR LA CELEBRACIÓN DE NUESTRO AMOR AL UNIRNOS EN
    MATRIMONIO.
  </p>

  <div class="heart-divider">♥</div>

  <div class="parents-block">
    <div class="parent-col">
      <span class="parent-label">PADRES DEL NOVIO</span>
      <p class="parent-name">SR. AGUSTÍN GALICIA FRAGOSO</p>
      <p class="parent-name">& SRA. BLANCA ESTELA GALICIA GARAY</p>
    </div>

    <div class="parent-col">
      <span class="parent-label">PADRES DE LA NOVIA</span>
      <p class="parent-name">SR. JOSÉ LINO CHAVARRIA VALDIVIA</p>
      <p class="parent-name">& SRA. MARIBEL VAZQUEZ BUSTOS</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section-intro {
    padding: 10px 10px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro-paragraph {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .heart-divider {
    color: var(--color-wine-pastel);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  .parents-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .parent-col {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .parent-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--color-wine-dark);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .parent-name {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
